;Item over limit on SCO
;Should only be allowed to sell 2 of these, this script will attempt to purchase 3
;Assumes SCO is logged in and ready for a normal sale

Sleep 3000 ;gives time to click on the main POS/SCO app, bring to focus
SetPause 1000 ;set time between commands to 1second for testing

Load SCO_buttons
Load shutup ;turn the volume down

;start
MouseClick start
MouseClick assistance
MouseClick store_login

SetPause 200
Load login
SetPause 1000

;first item
MouseClick assist_mode
MouseClick key_in_code

SetPause 200
Load item_over_limit
SetPause 1000

MouseClick return_shopping_mode
sleep 2000

;second item
MouseClick assist_mode
MouseClick key_in_code

SetPause 200
Load item_over_limit
SetPause 1000

MouseClick return_shopping_mode
sleep 2000

;third item
MouseClick assist_mode
MouseClick key_in_code

SetPause 200
Load item_over_limit
SetPause 1000

;shows an alert here
MouseClick excess_ok

MouseClick return_shopping_mode
sleep 2000

MouseClick pay
MouseClick other_payment_methods
MouseClick vendor_coupon
;$7.38
MouseClick l7
MouseClick l3
MouseClick l8
MouseClick lok
MouseClick login

SetPause 200
Load login
SetPause 1000

MouseClick yes ;this is to accept the vendor coupon
